Package: synveil
Version: @SYNVEIL_VERSION@
Architecture: @SYNVEIL_ARCH@
Maintainer: Synveil Project <synveil-dev@example.invalid>
Installed-Size: @SYNVEIL_INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @SYNVEIL_DEPENDS@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: Synveil desktop and background synchronization runtime (Linux)
 Synveil provides a desktop application for managing synchronized files and a
 separately supervised background synchronization client.
 .
 The desktop and client executables remain separate. The client user service
 is installed below /usr/lib/systemd/user. The client user service and
 scheduled-maintenance timer are NOT auto-enabled by package installation.
 Enable either only after reviewing the local configuration.
 .
 Installation does not launch Synveil or enable background services. Existing
 configuration, application state, profiles, and synchronized libraries are
 preserved when the package is removed normally.
